contributions.contribution:
Independent, read-only assessment of the full original outcome against the oracle rubric and the exact corrected candidate. It uses current admitted C2 re-measurement evidence and covers:
- the content of the authored assets and how each corresponds to the source and to its predecessor asset;
- verifier adequacy;
- whether the execution plan matches the fixed commands;
- the historical baseline-failure → correction relation.

Unmet or indeterminate criteria stay open. The assessing actor is distinct from the authors and the measurement producer.
